<title>ARGENTINA: SAGAL group buys 80 pct of Argentine pet food firm.</title>
<headline>SAGAL group buys 80 pct of Argentine pet food firm.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Royal Canin unit of French group Sagal has bought an 80 percent stake in Argentine pet food producer  Lawler S.A., Lawler said in a statement.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Lawler said it has a local market share of between 18 and 20 percent. Other details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires newsroom, 541 318-0618)</p>
</text>
